This actually a mistake. Daggers are one skill that should be raised to
expert as soon as possible, more importantly for characters that can
reach expert in them. Throwing expert +7 daggers does more damage on an
average than a double damage artifact like the staff of A. Also you
don't have to wield them. Enchanting Magicbane to +7 at expert also
does decent damage.

Anyway your character is more than ready. Just use magic missiles
whereever possible. You should have collected any wands of death for
the Rodney. You can also cast FoD on Rodney. For magic resistant
creatures Cone of Cold is great also. You can drop the Amulet before
casting if you are on land.

